-               Presorted Key: tenk1.four
-               ->  Sort
-                     Sort Key: tenk1.four
-                     ->  Seq Scan on tenk1
-         ->  Sort
-               Sort Key: t2.four, t2.two
-               ->  Seq Scan on tenk1 t2
