------------+--------
-        29 |     29
-(1 row)
-
-SELECT * FROM check_estimated_rows('SELECT * FROM functional_dependencies WHERE a = 1 AND b = ''1'' AND c = 1');
- estimated | actual 
------------+--------
-         3 |      3
-(1 row)
