-NOTICE:  f_leak => beafsteak
-NOTICE:  f_leak => hamburger
- cid |     name      |       tel        |  passwd   
------+---------------+------------------+-----------
- 101 | regress_alice | +81-12-3456-7890 | passwd123
-(1 row)
-
--- Cleanup.
-RESET SESSION AUTHORIZATION;
-DROP ROLE regress_alice;
