-TRUNCATE fk_partitioned_fk_2;
-ALTER TABLE fk_partitioned_fk ATTACH PARTITION fk_partitioned_fk_2 FOR VALUES FROM (1000,1000) TO (2000,2000);
--- The child constraint will also be valid.
