----------------------------------------------------------------------
- Subquery Scan on s
-   Filter: (s.c = 1)
-   ->  WindowAgg
-         Window: w1 AS (ROWS UNBOUNDED PRECEDING)
-         Run Condition: (ntile((InitPlan expr_1).col1) OVER w1 <= 1)
-         InitPlan expr_1
-           ->  Result
-         ->  Result
-(8 rows)
