- personnel |     2 |   3900 | 12-23-2006  |         1 |        2
- personnel |     5 |   3500 | 12-10-2007  |         2 |        1
- sales     |     1 |   5000 | 10-01-2006  |         1 |        3
- sales     |     4 |   4800 | 08-08-2007  |         3 |        1
