--- preserve buffer contents
-SELECT count(*), max(a) max_a, min(a) min_a, max(cnt) max_cnt FROM test_temp;
- count | max_a | min_a | max_cnt 
--------+-------+-------+---------
- 10000 | 10000 |     1 |       0
-(1 row)
-
