-                                QUERY PLAN                                 
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Append
-   ->  Seq Scan on nv_parent nv_parent_1
-         Filter: ((d >= '08-01-2011'::date) AND (d <= '08-31-2011'::date))
-   ->  Seq Scan on nv_child_2010 nv_parent_2
